OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were then whittled down to two
OL,7,Fwinners - with the faithful duo of
OL,8,Fcomedian Romesh Ranganathan and
OL,9,FHeartstopper actor Sebastian "Bash"
OL,10,FCroft emerging victorious.
